{
  "note": "Route families for apps/web vinext Worker builds. Ownership uses the OpenNext family rules (cloudflare/opennext/prune.ts) and its global deny list; sharpExclude lists API entries whose import closure reaches sharp, which Workers cannot load. A `rest` family owns every entry no other enabled family owns, except denied and sharp entries.",
